@startuml
actor HR
participant FE
participant ReportSvc
participant NotifSvc
database DB


HR -> FE : Tạo báo cáo vi phạm (đối tượng: Ứng viên/Công ty)
FE -> ReportSvc : createReport(hrId, targetId, reason, evidence)
ReportSvc -> DB : INSERT report
DB --> ReportSvc : ok
ReportSvc -> NotifSvc : notify(Admin, reportId)
NotifSvc --> ReportSvc : ack
ReportSvc --> FE : success + trackingId
@enduml